  "overheatedFadingDescription": "The coin has run up hard: the 24h or 7d rise is at least 4% and at least 2× its usual move, and it has not yet dropped more than its usual daily move. At least three of four cooling signs are present: RSI was 85+ within the day and has dropped by 5+ points; the price has pulled back 15–50% of the daily range from the high; the last hour and the last 6 hours are negative; the price is more than 1.5 usual daily moves above its 7-day average.",
